#: .\templates\index.html:128
msgid ""
"Biz bilan har bir taom — bu san'at. Haqiqiy ta'm va unutilmas lahzalar "
"maskani."
msgstr "Every meal with us is an art. A place of true taste and unforgettable moments."

#: .\templates\index.html:148 .\templates\index.html:225
msgid "Master Chefs"
msgstr "Master Chefs"

#: .\templates\index.html:149
msgid ""
"Oshpazimizning maxsus retseptlari asosida tayyorlangan eksklyuziv taomlar."
msgstr "Exclusive dishes prepared according to our chef's special recipes."

#: .\templates\index.html:157
msgid "Quality Food"
msgstr "Quality Food"

#: .\templates\index.html:158
msgid ""
"Maxsus saralangan Yevropa go'sht navlari, Dry-Aged texnologiyasida "
"pishitilgan sersharbat steyklar va klassik souslar."
msgstr "Specially selected European meats, juicy steaks cooked using Dry-Aged technology, and classic sauces."

#: .\templates\index.html:166
msgid "Online Order"
msgstr "Online Order"

#: .\templates\index.html:167
msgid ""
"Har bir buyurtma maxsus termopaketlarga qadoqlanib, taomning issiqligi va "
"asl ta'mi saqlangan holda tezkor yetkazib beriladi."
msgstr "Each order is packaged in special thermal packages, ensuring fast delivery while preserving the food's heat and original taste."

#: .\templates\index.html:175
msgid "24/7 Service"
msgstr "24/7 Service"

#: .\templates\index.html:176
msgid ""
"Tunning istalgan vaqtida oliy darajadagi ta'm va e'tibor.Biz sizning "
"vaqtingizni va qulayligingizni qadrlaymiz."
msgstr "Top notch taste and attention at any time of the night. We value your time and convenience."

#: .\templates\index.html:206 .\templates\index.html:461
msgid "About Us"
msgstr "About Us"

#: .\templates\index.html:207
msgid "Welcome to"
msgstr "Welcome to"

#: .\templates\index.html:208
msgid ""
"Bizning restoranimizga xush kelibsiz! Biz shunchaki taom tayyorlamaymiz, "
"balki har bir mehmonga samimiy mehmondoStatus va a'lo kayfiyat ulashamiz."
msgstr "Welcome to our restaurant! We don't just prepare food, we also offer sincere hospitality and a great mood to every guest."

#: .\templates\index.html:209
msgid ""
"Sarxil masalliqlar, mohir oshpazlarimiz mahorati va shinam muhit sizning "
"tashrifingizni unutilmas qiladi. Oila bag'rida tushlik qilish yoki maxsus "
"kunlarni nishonlash uchun eng maqbul tanlov!"
msgstr "The delicious ingredients, the skill of our expert chefs, and the cozy atmosphere will make your visit unforgettable. The perfect choice for a family lunch or to celebrate special occasions!"

