#: .\templates\index.html:419
msgid ""
"Toshkentdagi eng sifatli va nozik ta'mga ega Yevropa oshxonasi! Dry-Aged "
"pishitilgan go'sht va fransuz desertlari shunchaki san'at darajasida "
"tayyorlangan. Har bir taom uzatilganda oshpazning yuksak mahorati sezilib "
"turadi. Albatta, yana qaytib kelaman."
msgstr "The highest quality and most delicately flavoured European cuisine in Tashkent! Dry-Aged cooked meats and French desserts are simply a work of art. The chef's high skill is evident when each dish is served. I will definitely be back."

#: .\templates\index.html:430
msgid ""
"Nikohimizning yilligini nishonlash uchun VIP zonani band qilgandik. Xodimlar "
"e'tibori, stoldagi nozik bezaklar va jonli musiqali muhit kechamizni "
"ertaknamo qildi. Tun yarmi bo'lishiga qaramay, xizmat ko'rsatish darajasi va "
"taomlar issiqligi a'lo darajada edi."
msgstr "We booked the VIP area to celebrate our wedding anniversary. The attentiveness of the staff, the delicate decorations on the tables, and the live music atmosphere made our evening a fairytale. Despite it being midnight, the level of service and the hotness of the food were excellent."

#: .\templates\index.html:441
msgid ""
"Ko'p davlatlarda bo'laman va Yevropa Fine Dining standartlarini yaxshi "
"bilaman. Ushbu restoran men kutgandan ham a'lo xizmat ko'rsatdi. Tasodifan "
"online buyurtma xizmatidan ham foydalandim — qadoqlanishi va tezkorligi "
"hayratlanarli. Haqiqiy premium daraja!"
msgstr "I have been to many countries and am familiar with European Fine Dining standards. This restaurant provided excellent service beyond my expectations. I also happened to use the online ordering service — the packaging and speed are amazing. Truly premium!"

